OL,3,GNEWSANew free repair shop to launch in
OL,4,AOxford
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree help with repairing bikes,
OL,7,Felectrical items, computers and clothes
OL,8,Fis coming to an Oxford neighbourhood.
OL,10,FOn Saturday, the first Jericho Repair
OL,11,FShop will take place at St Barnabas CE
OL,12,FPrimary School, in Jericho, between 10
OL,13,Fand 12:00 BST.
OL,15,FOrganiser John Mair said everyone was
OL,16,Fwelcome to come along and donations
OL,17,Fwould go back into rental costs and
OL,18,Fadvertising for the event, which he
OL,19,Fhoped would continue on a monthly
OL,20,Fbasis.
